    <string name="about_description_title">About This App</string>
    <string name="app_description">Keep a complete record of your income, expenses, budgets, accounts, and savings in one place. Manage your personal finances safely offline with হিসাবনিকাশ (HisabNikash), powered by DZ Ai-STUDIO. Tailored for Bangladesh (BDT ৳) with Cash, Bank, bKash, Nagad, and Rocket accounts, exact poisha math, atomic transfers, monthly budget threshold alerts, earmarked savings goals, recurring bill rules, UTF-8 CSV and Bangla PDF reports, biometric app lock, and AES-256-GCM encrypted backups.</string>

